   "cmd": "open gunbelt",
   "reply": ">open gunbelt Opened. Off near the fireplace, the sheik and the fairy queen are conversing with a small group. The fairy is emphasizing some point when suddenly, she manages to spill her drink on her gown. Her reaction is audible even where you are standing, and she stalks off. >",
