  {
   "cmd": "w",
   "reply": ">w Ballroom, Near Fireplace This is the south end of the ballroom. A huge fieldstone fireplace dominates the south wall. The bar is to the east. Elsewhere in this large ballroom, there are scores of other party guests dressed in all sorts of outlandish costumes. On the dance floor are some of the older dancers. The band is playing \"Breathless.\" On the periphery of the room small groups can be seen, discussing everything from politics to local scandals. Johnson and Ostmann are at the bar. There's a broken glass here. Michael, costumed as a sheik, is here. >",
   "bitChanges": [],
