   "cmd": "n",
   "reply": ">n Ballroom, Near French Door This is near the middle of the ballroom, at a French door leading out to the patio. Elsewhere in this large ballroom, there are scores of other party guests dressed in all sorts of outlandish costumes, such as a man who looks like Cardinal Richelieu. On the dance floor are some of the older dancers. The band is playing \"I Left My Heart in San Francisco.\" On the periphery of the room small groups can be seen, discussing everything from politics to local scandals. Michael is near the fireplace. Johnson and Ostmann are at the bar. The Astronaut is now near the south entrance. >",
