  {
   "cmd": "n",
   "reply": ">n Ballroom, Near Kitchen The northern end of the ballroom, next to the door leading to the kitchen. To the west is a band platform. Elsewhere in this large ballroom, there are scores of other party guests dressed in all sorts of outlandish costumes, such as three people dressed as mice wearing dark glasses. On the dance floor are some of the older dancers. The band is playing \"I Left My Heart in San Francisco.\" On the periphery of the room small groups can be seen, discussing everything from politics to local scandals. The Astronaut is near the south entrance. Michael is near the fireplace. Johnson and Ostmann are at the bar. The Astronaut is now near the center entrance. >",
